{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\RoomVox\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "autoloader-authoritative",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "composer.json: config.classmap-authoritative"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The Composer autoloader is optimized beyond level 1. The manual allows only config.optimize-autoloader: an authoritative class map breaks the upgrade of the app, and APCu is no required extension.",
        "  composer.json: config.classmap-authoritative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "private-api",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/UserBackend/RoomUserBackend.php:20 OC\\User\\Backend"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use of the private API of the server in 1 file. Only OCP and NCU are public: what is below OC changes without notice between majors.",
        "  lib/UserBackend/RoomUserBackend.php:20 OC\\User\\Backend"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dav-without-preload",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Dav/RoomVisibilityPlugin.php:55 OCA\\RoomVox\\Dav\\RoomVisibilityPlugin"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 DAV plugin listens to propFind and not to preloadCollection, which the server emits from Nextcloud 32 on before it reads the children of a collection. Without that listener a PROPFIND with Depth above 0 runs the queries of the plugin once per child.",
        "  lib/Dav/RoomVisibilityPlugin.php:55 OCA\\RoomVox\\Dav\\RoomVisibilityPlugin"
      ]
    },
